ages/encyclopedia/thumbs/archduke-franz-ferdinand-of-austria.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austria</span><span class="tp">1863–1914</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/italo-balbo"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/italo-balbo.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Italo Balbo</span><span class="tp">1896–1940</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/clifford-dupont"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/clifford-dupont.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Clifford Dupont</span><span class="tp">1905–1978</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/yigael-yadin"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/yigael-yadin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Yigael Yadin</span><span class="tp">1917–1984</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/vere-bird"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/vere-bird.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Vere Bird</span><span class="tp">1910–1999</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
